00:31:18 [----] PHRASING VARIETY — vary the sentence opener across the whole set; do NOT start most questions with "Get me" or "I want". Rotate among natural openers such as "Can you find ...", "Let's find ...", "Can you bring me ...", "Show me ...", "Where is ...", "I'm looking for ...", "Which one is ...", "Find ...".
