00:31:18 [----] UNIQUENESS RULE — a target's 3 questions must each use a DIFFERENT property or association, and every question must fit ONLY its own target among the toys (use a distinguishing feature no other listed toy shares).
00:31:18 [----] Use simple, clear language appropriate for ages 4-6.
