21:18:18 [7293] - cross classification: Ask whether one item can be classified in multiple valid ways. e.g. Is an apple both fruit and food?
21:18:18 [7293] - superordinate subordinate reasoning: Ask whether an item is a kind of another category, or whether one category is broader than another. e.g. Is a poodle a kind of dog?
