rrect answer depends on context, culture, family rules, or personal preference. Developmental guidance for this child (from the SLP knowledge base) — use it ONLY to set how long and simple the question wording should be. Do NOT bend the question toward particular words or sounds; the questions must stay natural, general, and about the topic(s) above:
