21:19:41 [8897] - friendship development: Understanding how to make and maintain friendships. Skills: finding common interests, choosing appropriate peers, inviting someone to play, being a good host.
21:19:41 [8897] - emotion understanding: Recognizing and discussing emotions in self and others. Skills: identifying basic emotions, linking emotions to causes, noticing facial, body, and context cues, expressing one's own feeling.
21:19:41 [8897] - perspective taking theory of mind: Understanding that another person may think, know, feel, or want something different. Skills: identifying another person's belief, understanding different preferences, predicting how someone may react, explaining why someone acted a certain way.
