23:27:25 [bdba] Cover a diverse mix of these social-communication targets (do not repeat the same one):
23:27:25 [bdba] - reciprocal conversation: Starting, maintaining, and ending a conversation with a peer. Skills: greeting, asking a relevant question, answering on topic, trading information.
