23:57:42 [6d10] Developmental order (easiest first): what -> who -> where -> when -> why -> how.
23:57:42 [6d10] Recommended WH types: what, who, where, when, why, how.
23:57:42 [6d10] - Use why/how for explanation, comparison, problem solving, social inference, and narrative reasoning when clinically appropriate.
23:57:42 [6d10] - Keep questions concrete and contextually grounded.
